Idle Clans Sentinel

This repository's source code is made available for transparency and
community review.

1. PERMITTED USES

   You may:

   - View, read, and study the source code.
   - Fork the repository for personal use, experimentation, or to propose
     changes (e.g. via pull request).
   - Run the application from source on your own machine for your own
     personal use.
   - Modify the source code for your own personal, non-distributed use.

2. NOT PERMITTED

   You may not, without asking first:

   - Distribute, publish, or share compiled/packaged builds (executables,
     installers, portable apps, or any other distributable) of
     Sentinel, whether unmodified or modified.
   - Distribute modified source code as, or as part of, a separate
     application or tool intended for use by others.

3. OFFICIAL BUILDS

   The only builds of this software intended for use are those
   published via the official Sentinel GitHub Releases page
   for this repository. Builds distributed from any other source are not
   official and are not endorsed, supported, or guaranteed to be safe.

4. CONTRIBUTIONS

   By submitting a pull request or other contribution to this repository,
   you agree that your contribution may be incorporated into the project
   and distributed under these same terms as part of official builds.

5. QUESTIONS / PERMISSIONS

   If you'd like to do something with this code that isn't covered above —
   including building and sharing your own version with others — please
   reach out first. Most reasonable requests are likely to be fine; this
   license exists to keep "the official Sentinel build" meaning something,
   not to discourage collaboration.
